            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo muherezi yishura Dawidi, ati Nta mitsima isanzwe mfise, atar’ iyejejwe; n’imiburiburi iyaba iyo mikangara idaherūkanye n’ abagore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi yishura uwo muherezi, ati Vy’ukuri haciye imisi itatu dutandukanye n’abagore; kandi twavuye i muhira ibintu vy’iyo mikangara vyejejwe, nah’ ar’ urugendo nk’izindi. Non’ uyu musi ibintu vyabo ntibiheza bikarushiriza kuba ivyera? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ uwo muherezi amuha imitsima yejejwe, kukw ata yindi yariho atar’ iy’ ibiterekērwa, iyo bāhora bakūra imbere y’Uhoraho, bagasubizah’ iyigishūshe ku musi bayikūyeho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
