              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo muherezi aramwishura, ati Ya nkota ya Goliyati wa Mufilisitiya watsinda mu mwonga Ela, ehe ngiyi iri hano, izingiriwekw impuzu inyuma ya efodi; ni wagomba kuyijana, uyijane, kukw ata yindi iri hano atar’ iyo. Dawidi aramwishura, ati Nta yiruta iyo; yimpe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
